        <briefdescription>
<para>Constructs a unique seed from grid cell index and model date/time The perm is supplied we generate a different seed by circularly shifting the bits of the seed - this is useful if we want to create more than one seed for a given column and model date/time. Note that abs(perm) must be &lt;= the number of bits used to represent the default integer (likely 32) </para>        </briefdescription>
