    <briefdescription>
<para>Generic module to wrap random number generators. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The module defines a type that identifies the particular stream of random numbers, and has procedures for initializing it and getting real numbers in the range 0 to 1. This version uses the Mersenne Twister to generate random numbers on [0, 1]. </para>    </detaileddescription>
